{"id": "msg_8de9614ee5794d36b704e4d32ca23d43", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "全部 45 条摘要与仓库映射已就位。我用一个批量证据脚本对每个\"所属项目\"定位到本地仓库，grep 记忆中的高区分度标识（函数名/组件名/接口名），一次性收集实机核对证据，再逐条二态判定——这是处理 45 条同构对象最省 token 的方式。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "chatcmpl-tool-84b9b4fe772828ae", "tool_name": "write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "C:/Users/Administrator/.dsh/cache/memory-audit/evidence.py", "content": "import os, json, io\n\nBASE='D:/repository'\nCACHE='C:/Users/Administrator/.dsh/cache/memory-audit/'\nsel=json.load(open(CACHE+'select.json',encoding='utf-8'))\ncands=sel['candidates']\n\n# idx -> (repo dirnames, keywords)\nplan={\n 2:(['无锡市区小程序嵌入H5'],['getH5Selection','getHouseInfo']),\n 3:(['园区物管2.0'],['zs-table-container--with-summary','bottom-summary-variant']),\n 5:(['园区物管2.0'],['mapOverview']),\n 6:(['园区物管2.0'],['getDonutSlicePercent','parseAssetCategories']),\n 7:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],['formMode','OperationBtnGroup']),\n 8:(['园区物管2.0'],['pubRegulatoryAccount','currentProjectId']),\n 9:(['园区V0'],['froala']),\n 10:(['苏住房C'],['w-500','owner-card']),\n 11:(['小程序'],['H5_EXTERNAL_URL_STORAGE_KEY','h5ExternalWebview']),\n 12:(['苏住房G'],['complexFieldConfig','zs-advanced-query']),\n 13:(['苏住房G'],['companyRegister']),\n 14:(['园区V0','锡山物管V0','园区公共收益','无锡市区G'],['MtplOwnerVoteOptionComServiceImpl']),\n 15:(['园区公共收益'],['CandidateTable']),\n 16:(['产品2.0','苏住房G','苏州市房地产监测V3','园区物管2.0'],['tencentDistrictBoundary']),\n 17:(['产品2.0'],['pubManagementOrg']),\n 18:(['苏住房G'],['monthlyReport']),\n 19:(['产品2.0'],['selectRangeDialog','deptTree']),\n 20:(['太仓G'],['fundUsageKs']),\n 21:(['苏住房C'],['ZsRichText','cancellationWarning']),\n 22:(['宿迁苏服办'],['fwzlhtba']),\n 23:(['苏住房C'],['budgetSubjectName']),\n 24:(['苏住房C'],['TypeChoose']),\n 25:(['产品2.0'],['facilityDefinition']),\n 26:(['苏住房C'],['swiperComponent']),\n 27:(['i淮安公版'],['manifest']),\n 28:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],['/detail']),\n 29:(['无锡市区小程序嵌入H5'],['sfbFaceAuth']),\n 30:(['苏住房C'],['pages_transaction/intention']),\n 31:(['产品2.0','苏住房C','苏住房G','园区物管2.0'],['zhi2-pro']),\n 33:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],['detailMixins']),\n 34:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],['detailMixins']),\n 36:(['泰兴小程序'],['issue']),\n 37:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],[]),\n 38:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],['zs-textarea','detail-form']),\n 39:(['园区公共收益'],['InfoDialog','dialogMixins']),\n 40:(['园区公共收益'],['resyncTableLayout','generation']),\n 41:(['产品2.0'],['regionCode','pubHouse']),\n 42:(['无锡市区小程序嵌入H5'],['ProDeal','transDetail']),\n 43:(['苏州市房地产监测V3'],['DeveloperBasicInfoDetail','qualification']),\n 44:(['园区物管2.0','园区公共收益','产品2.0','苏住房G'],['preparatoryRangeTable','isSyncingSelection']),\n 45:(['产品2.0','苏住房G','园区物管2.0'],['mapState']),\n}\n\nEXTS={'.vue','.js','.ts','.scss','.css','.json','.java','.shtml','.html','.jsx','.tsx','.py'}\nSKIP={'node_modules','.git','dist','build','.idea','unpackage','.vscode','.cache','coverage'}\n\ndef scan(repo,kws):\n    root=os.path.join(BASE,repo)\n    hit={k:[] for k in kws}\n    if not os.path.isdir(root): return None,hit\n    for dp,dn,fn in os.walk(root):\n        dn[:]=[d for d in dn if d not in SKIP]\n        for name in fn:\n            if os.path.splitext(name)[1].lower() not in EXTS: continue\n            fp=os.path.join(dp,name)\n            try:\n                txt=open(fp,encoding='utf-8',errors='ignore').read()\n            except Exception:\n                continue\n            rel=os.path.relpath(fp,root)\n            for k in kws:\n                if k in txt and len(hit[k])<3:\n                    hit[k].append(rel)\n    return root,hit\n\nout=io.open(CACHE+'evidence.txt','w',encoding='utf-8')\nfor i in range(1,46):\n    c=cands[i-1]\n    out.write(\"=== [%d] sha=%s %s\\n\"%(i,c['body_sha256_16'],c['uri'].split('/')[-1]))\n    if i==1:\n        p=os.path.join(BASE,'产品2.0')\n        out.write(\"  dir_exists=%s\\n\"%os.path.isdir(p))\n        gc=os.path.join(p,'.git','config')\n        if os.path.exists(gc):\n            out.write(\"  git_urls=%s\\n\"%[l.strip() for l in open(gc,encoding='utf-8',errors='ignore') if 'url' in l][:3])\n        continue\n    if i==4:\n        p='C:/Users/Administrator/.cursor'\n        out.write(\"  cursor_dir_exists=%s\\n\"%os.path.isdir(p))\n        if os.path.isdir(p):\n            out.write(\"  cursor_file_count=%d\\n\"%sum(len(f) for _,_,f in os.walk(p)))\n        continue\n    if i in (32,35):\n        for ln in c['content'].split('\\n'): out.write(\"    FULL:\"+ln+\"\\n\")\n        continue\n    repos,kws=plan.get(i,([],[]))\n    for repo in repos:\n        root,hit=scan(repo,kws)\n        if root is None:\n            out.write(\"  repo[%s]=MISSING\\n\"%repo); continue\n        parts=[]\n        for k,fs in hit.items():\n            parts.append(\"%s:%d%s\"%(k,len(fs),('('+','.join(fs)+')') if fs else ''))\n        out.write(\"  repo[%s] %s\\n\"%(repo,' | '.join(parts) if parts else '(no kw)'))\n    if i==37:\n        for ln in c['content'].split('\\n'): out.write(\"    FULL:\"+ln+\"\\n\")\nout.close()\nprint(\"done\")\n"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-26T13:06:08.548Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
